on"}, {"id": "138b37c8-9b3e-4d68-932f-d66810b3a8aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Self-assessment of interpretive growth"}], "description": "Students synthesize their learning and identify next steps for upper-division literature study."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$ihisjson$::jsonb,
